WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.727
In this clip, a content editor creates a new blog post in Varbase and saves it as a draft.

2
00:00:07.727 --> 00:00:16.633
In the sidebar, open Create and choose Blog post. The form opens, with the settings on the right.

3
00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:26.303
Type a clear title. Then write a short description. It appears in lists and in search results.

4
00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:34.719
Write the body of the post in the rich text editor. Use headings and lists to make it easy to read.

5
00:00:34.719 --> 00:00:56.715
In the sidebar, keep Save as on Draft, and click Save. The post is saved, but visitors cannot see it yet.
